## 7. Quick reference — commands

```bash
# State
sssctl domain-list
sssctl domain-status <domain>
sssctl user-show <user>
sssctl user-checks <user> -s sshd -a acct
sssctl config-check

# Resolution
getent passwd <user>
getent group <group>
id <user>
getent passwd -s sss <user>      # force SSSD, bypass /etc/passwd
getent passwd -s files <user>    # local only — reveals shadowing

# Cache
sss_cache -E
sss_cache -u <user>
systemctl stop sssd; rm -rf /var/lib/sss/db/*; systemctl start sssd

# Kerberos
klist -kte /etc/krb5.keytab
kinit -k
kvno host/$(hostname -f)

# Join state
realm list
adcli info corp.example.com
```

